    "en": {
      "title": "Manual pumps",
      "h1": "Häny – Manual concrete pumps (IC)",
      "description": "There are several manual variants depending on volume and pressure requirements. The compact IC310, IC311 and IC325 units are best sellers. The model name gives a hint…",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "image",
          "alt": "Häny – Manual concrete pumps (IC)",
          "width": 876,
          "height": 510,
          "src": "/assets/img/haeny-automatiska-pumpar-1.webp",
          "href": "/produkter/haeny"
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "alt": "Häny – Manual concrete pumps (IC) – image 2",
          "width": 1920,
          "height": 1315,
          "src": "/assets/img/haeny-manuella-pumpar-2.webp"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "html": "There are several manual variants depending on volume and pressure requirements. The compact IC310, IC311 and IC325 units are best sellers. The model name gives a hint about the total volume of mixer and agitator, and the last digit indicates which type of piston pump (ZMP) is used. IC310 has a slightly higher working pressure than IC311, while IC311 is a little cheaper. On the IC311 the maximum pressure is 75 bar instead of 100 bar as on the IC310, but it has a higher flow of 2 m³/hour."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "html": "The <a href=\"/produkter/haeny/manuella-pumpar/ic-325-ic325-ccp\">IC325</a> variant, unlike the IC310, has two piston pumps, which gives a smoother flow. The maximum pressure is 100 bar and the maximum flow is 2 m³/hour. This model can also be combined with a module for PU injection."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "html": "Below are the pump flow graphs for each pump. Click the pump of interest to go to the brochure and get more information about the pump."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "html": "<a href=\"/kontakta-oss\">Contact us</a> for further information."
